  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.33 - AM003 immutable/frozen container conversions\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM003 reports collection-container mismatches when destination members use ImmutableList, ImmutableHashSet, or FrozenSet\n            - AM003 code fixes emit fully qualified ImmutableList.CreateRange, ImmutableHashSet.CreateRange, and FrozenSet.ToFrozenSet factory calls\n            - Immutable/frozen AM003 fixes preserve the existing AM003/AM021 ownership split and reuse safe element conversions when needed\n            - AM003 analyzer and code-fix regression coverage now locks immutable/frozen destination behavior\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (824 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - GitHub PR checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.32 - Property-level AM004/AM006 diagnostics",
